    "description": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This hybrid sauna for groups up to five people is a neat addition to any home. The beautifully designed sauna can be used in groups to relax and by individuals for exercise. If relaxing in the sauna is not enough for you, perhaps this sauna would be a good sport to stretch and to exercise.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">As a hybrid sauna, it features a mix of electric Harvia heaters and infrared heaters for thorough sweating sessions. The health benefits that saunas are associated with are broad and well-researched so this sauna will be helpful to the whole family or a group of friends. Share it or use it alone.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span>Diamond&nbsp;</span>series of saunas favor privacy, and therefore do not feature as many see-through windows as the Vitality models. However, the components of natural wood make up for the lack of glass with a top-notch natural feel and look. It is more of a traditional look but there are windows to allow natural light in just not as much as the Vitality models.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This is a fantastic sauna that will be popular in any setting.</span></p>",
